      "side": 1,
      "message": "oh yeah, +1 to this, and +makoto too as he\u0027s probably interested.\n\nI think we ought to start a discussion on metalava-discuss with Tor to get some historical context about whether we can get rid of these separate metalava runs for docs. The way it\u0027s all wired together now these sources end up being parsed by metalava so many times...",
