        "id": 1039338
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-22T15:38:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We do need the whole comment as the reason for adding this is for the purposes of generating the public Javadoc. Adding in comments to all the stubs source would make each of those metalava invocations slightly more expensive.\n\nThe docs stubs not only include the comments but also changes the way that the annotations are transformed into the output so there are functional differences between docs and non-docs stubs.\n\nThe main reason for making this configurable per scope and not enabled by default is to minimize the number of additional metalava invocations.\n\nWe should eventually be able to remove the droidstubs invocations in frameworks/base altogether (or only apply them to the frameworks platform source) once all the modules contribute sources in the correct format.",
      "parentUuid": "67d14bd8_16f09a1b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 17
      },
